land</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Deutsch</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Russland</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>Russisch</span></td></tr></table><h3>📌 Глаголы wohnen и kommen</h3><table border='1' cellpadding='12' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Местоимение</th><th>wohnen</th><th>kommen</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td><strong>ich</strong></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>wohne</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>komme</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td><strong>du</strong></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>wohnst</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>kommst</span></td></tr></table>",
